    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Ops by node",
      "description": "**面板作用**\n单 host 内各 node **客户端 ops/s (与 QPS 同义)** (counter rate), 用于对比节点负载是否倾斜.\n\n**图示/阈值**\n每条曲线 = 一个 `node_id`; 单位 ops/s, 对齐 Redis INFO `instantaneous_ops_per_sec` / `total_commands_processed` 口径.\n\n**排除** 内部伪命令 (命令名含 `.`, 如 `GOSSIP.tick`, `CLUSTER.redirect.*`, `JSON.*`); MOVED/ASK 不计入 commandstats.\n\n无面板级颜色阈值 (palette-classic).\n\n**数据来源**\naikv/aidb 进程 → OTLP gRPC (:4317) → OTel Collector → Prometheus remote write\nResource 标签: `service_name=aikv`, `cluster`, `host_name`, `node_id`\n\n**PromQL**\n`sum(rate(aikv_commands_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\",aikv_command_name!~\".*\\\\..*\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (node_id)`",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(aikv_commands_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\",aikv_command_name!~\".*\\\\..*\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (node_id)",
          "legendFormat": "node {{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory RSS",
      "description": "**面板作用**\n各 node 进程 **RSS** (resident set size), 与 INFO `used_memory_rss` 同口径.\n\n**图示/阈值**\n每条曲线 = 一个 `node_id`, 单位 bytes; 来源 `/proc` VmRSS, refresh 周期同步到 OTLP.\n\n与同栏「Container memory」口径不同: 本面板为 aikv 进程 RSS (OTLP); 后者为 cAdvisor cgroup working set (通常接近但不完全相等).\n\nINFO `used_memory` (逻辑/data set 近似) 见 Engine 面板或 `aikv_used_memory_bytes`.\n\n无面板级颜色阈值 (palette-classic).\n\n**数据来源**\naikv/aidb 进程 → OTLP gRPC (:4317) → OTel Collector → Prometheus remote write\nResource 标签: `service_name=aikv`, `cluster`, `host_name`, `node_id`\n\n**PromQL**\n`aikv_process_resident_memory_bytes{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}`",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "aikv_process_resident_memory_bytes{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}",
          "legendFormat": "node {{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
