      "id": 24,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Container memory",
      "description": "**面板作用**\n各 aikv 容器 working set 内存 (cAdvisor), 按 compose service (`aikv-N`).\n\n**图示/阈值**\n每条曲线 = 一个容器.\n\n与同栏「Memory RSS」口径不同: 本面板为 **容器 cgroup working set**; 后者为 aikv 进程 RSS (OTLP `/proc` VmRSS).\n\n无面板级颜色阈值 (palette-classic).\n\n**数据来源**\nAlloy cAdvisor (:8088) → Prometheus scrape\n过滤: `container_label_app=aikv`, `container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~aikv-(${node:pipe})`\n\n**PromQL**\n`sum by (container_label_com_docker_compose_service) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{host=~\"$host\",container_label_app=\"aikv\",container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~\"aikv-(${node:pipe})\"})`",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (container_label_com_docker_compose_service) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{host=~\"$host\",container_label_app=\"aikv\",container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~\"aikv-(${node:pipe})\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{container_label_com_docker_compose_service}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
