      "id": 26,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Container CPU",
      "description": "**面板作用**\n各 aikv 容器 CPU 使用率 (cAdvisor), 按 compose service (`aikv-N`).\n\n**图示/阈值**\n值为 `rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{cpu=\"total\"})` (核·秒/秒, 可 >1 若多线程).\n\n低 CPU 时曲线仍可能呈阶梯状 (cAdvisor counter 特性); housekeeping 15s 与 Prom scrape 对齐后可减轻.\n\n无面板级颜色阈值 (palette-classic).\n\n**数据来源**\nworker cAdvisor (:8088) → monitor Prometheus scrape (`job=cadvisor`)\n过滤: `container_label_app=aikv`, `cpu=total`, `container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~aikv-(${node:pipe})`\n\n**PromQL**\n`sum by (container_label_com_docker_compose_service) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{host=~\"$host\",container_label_app=\"aikv\",container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~\"aikv-(${node:pipe})\",cpu=\"total\",image!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval]))`",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (container_label_com_docker_compose_service) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{host=~\"$host\",container_label_app=\"aikv\",container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~\"aikv-(${node:pipe})\",cpu=\"total\",image!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{container_label_com_docker_compose_service}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
