      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Ops by cmd",
      "description": "**面板作用**\n各客户端命令 ops/s 曲线; 排除内部伪命令 (含 `.`) 与 MOVED/ASK; 对齐 Redis commandstats.\n\n**图示/阈值**\nlegend 表 mean/max, 按 Max 排序.\n\n**数据来源**\naikv/aidb 进程 → OTLP gRPC (:4317) → OTel Collector → Prometheus remote write\nResource 标签: `service_name=aikv`, `cluster`, `host_name`, `node_id`\n\n**PromQL**\n`sum(rate(aikv_commands_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\",aikv_command_name!~\".*\\\\..*\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (aikv_command_name)`\n\n**调优**\n某命令占比过高 → 批量/缓存; SET/GET 比例异常 → 检查业务模式.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
