      "title": "Gossip & Failover",
      "description": "**面板作用**\n**Gossip**: 拓扑后台刷新 tick (非 Redis bus PING); **Failover**: 副本提升事件.\n\n**图示/阈值**\nGossip 为低频 baseline; Failover 正常情况下应为 0, 出现时需查主从切换.\n\n**No data 常见原因**\n1. Gossip 需 cluster `metrics` 注入 (新版 aikv) + 重部署\n2. 时间范围内无 failover → 仅 gossip 线或全 0\n3. 变量过滤无实例\n\n**数据来源**\naikv/aidb → OTLP (:4317) → OTel Collector → Prom remote write\nResource: `cluster`, `host_name`, `node_id`\n\n**PromQL**\n`rate(aikv_gossip_messages_total)` / `rate(aikv_failover_total)`",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 64
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(aikv_gossip_messages_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (node_id)",
          "legendFormat": "gossip node {{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(aikv_failover_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (node_id)",
          "legendFormat": "failover node {{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
